# Your business capabilities

Run `auggy augment create orders --with-skill` to generate a
schema, tool and route adapter, sample lookup service, and focused tests. Replace
the sample with a narrow adapter to your existing system of record. Augments own
identity, authorization, schemas, tools, routes and domain logic.

The command registers the capability once in the central YAML. Optional
instructions live at `skills/orders/SKILL.md`; root `skills/` is the only mounted
skill surface. Removing a declaration retains your source and skills; retained
skills remain model-visible until you explicitly remove them.

Built-ins remain installed under `node_modules/auggy/src`. Use `auggy inspect`
to locate their exact installed implementations. Dependency upgrades deliver
runtime and security updates without rewriting your source or skills.
